 🦬  Hairy (2)   🪒  Shaving (1)   🐑  Shorn (1)   🕒  Recent (4)   ⭐  Starred (0)   🛖  Sheds (…)

◂ Help — keys
│ Farm git state (the chip on the tab row)
│   W             Commit the farm (yaks commit)
│   U             Sync the farm: commit, pull, push (yaks sync)
│   chip          ● N uncommitted, ↑ahead, ↓behind, not published; none when clean
│
│ Sheds tab (every checkout: yaks sheds)
│   j / k         Move between sheds (attention first)
│   l / Enter     Show the shed's changes (yaks changes)
│   j / k (detail)Move between its changed yaks (outstanding first, landed fold below)
│   Enter (on ▸ N landed)Show / hide the landed yaks
│   J / K (detail)Next / previous shed
│   Enter (detail)Open the yak (its shed-only row if not here)
│   a (detail)    Answer its ask in that shed (uncommitted there)
│   y             Copy the shed's path (detail: the yak id)
│   r             Rescan now (auto every 10 s)
│
j/k scroll · d/u page · g/G top/bottom · ?/q/Esc close
